Pili-- is a modified distribution of PiliPlus.

Upstream: https://github.com/bggRGjQaUbCoE/PiliPlus
Imported revision: 72ec31edd6b34883f13ba8caf4e4d76e548ce884
Earlier projects: https://github.com/guozhigq/pilipala
                  https://github.com/orz12/PiliPalaX

The upstream LICENSE and source copyright notices are retained.
Pili-- modifications beginning on 2026-10-27 are distributed under GPL version 3
or, where the original file permits, any later version. See LICENSE.
New Pili-- source files are licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Modifications include Android application identity, QR scanning, built-in
native mall browsing with configurable navigation, transport/WebView hardening, removal of private
storage export and hidden URL entry, reproducible Android build preparation,
and project documentation. Git history records the individual modifications.

Dependencies retain their own licenses. Flutter's generated license registry
and the in-app open-source licenses screen provide dependency notices.
The original logo and retained platform sources are inherited from PiliPlus;
the Android application ID and visible name distinguish this distribution.
